WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone is about to start!

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.940
Shinsuke, are you okay?

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.610
I'm... fine...

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:17.930
That power was unbelievable!

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:22.700
Let's make it one more point before the game ends.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:23.290
What?

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.930
This is a soccer battle.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.640
Whoever scores two points first will be the winner.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.380
Not like you can to begin with.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:32.840
We accept your challenge.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:37.410
Our fight with you as caused us to lose our leader Alpha.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.330
Through our anger, you will pay.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.030
Anger?

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:25.430
Shinsuke, it's okay.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:26.640
Things will work out!

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:30.370
Now, let's have some fun.

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:32.810
C'mon, gimme what you've got!

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:35.710
Don't block them!

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:38.980
Let them have free reign.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.120
Just try and aim right here!

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:43.120
Interesting.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.740
Guys, let's go!

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:45.340
Okay!

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.420
Okay!

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:52.170
Here I go!

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.590
Sengoku War God Musashi!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:01.320
Armed!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:04.760
No way...

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:07.030
That's about it.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:10.520
Hmm, so fighting spirit isn't enough!

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.800
C'mon, Nishiki! Get moving!

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:15.790
In that case...

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.390
Bushin Renzan!

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:26.810
Tenma!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.110
Make it a shoot chain!

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.430
Okay!

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:33.940
True Mach Wind!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.820
Keeper Command 03!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.040
<Boom Shout>

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:41.690
What?

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.230
We're not done yet!

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.920
Offense Command 04!

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.350
<Spinning Upper>

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:01.900
Tsurugi!

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:07.580
Shoot Command 06!

00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:11.640
<Plasma Ball>

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:13.770
We won't make it!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:14.390
Shinsuke!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.900
I'll stop it!

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:19.460
Majin...

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.290
Tenma! Shinsuke!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.010
What is that Avatar?!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.760
Dark Exodus?

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.060
Which means...

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:00.420
What was that Avatar?

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:02.300
I don't know.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.490
I lack information.

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:05.630
This is Einam.

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:10.200
You seem busy, but do you have a minute?

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:11.660
Leader.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:18.580
You had me worried when you suddenly disappeared like that.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.450
I went to engage in combat with Raimon.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:22.920
There are four others besides me.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.260
And you didn't even get the Chairman's permission?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:28.500
Einam, you're such a bad boy.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:31.650
I apologize for acting without consultation.

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:37.270
But as Raimon continues to intervene with us, I considered it an urgent matter to remove them immediately.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:42.310
Their activity may even send you to Infinity Prison.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.200
Well, how considerate!

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.700
You were worried about me?

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:49.100
So, how did the battle end?

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:52.300
Unfortunately, it could not be carried out.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:54.080
Did you lose?

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:54.840
No.

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:59.980
An Avatar of unknown origins came in our way and escaped with the enemy.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:04.440
We are about to begin following in pursuit.

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:06.360
Okay.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:08.660
Be very careful.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:09.460
Yes.

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:15.590
It's like seeing two sly characters trying to outfox the other.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.160
Chairman.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.090
You were listening?

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:22.050
Those five are loyal only to Alpha.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:25.000
They must be intent on getting their revenge.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.920
Yes, I think so too.

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:34.790
They'll be in for a scare once they come back.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.970
But I'll be having fun.

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.160
Shinsuke!

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.780
This statue...

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:54.800
Yeah!

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:56.040
What is that?

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:58.780
It's the soccer god of this island.

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:00.020
God?

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.660
I found it the last time we were here.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:10.950
Hey there.

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:12.400
Shuu!

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:14.320
I knew it was you!

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.350
It's been awhile!

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.350
Thanks for saving us!

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:19.070
I'm glad I made it in time.

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:22.120
So soccer is in trouble again.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:24.350
I couldn't sit still after I heard about it.

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:28.900
It sounds like you haven't felt the effects of the soccer ban here.

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.800
Of course not.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.350
I'm okay.

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:33.960
Is he a friend of yours?

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:34.760
Yeah.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.800
This is Shuu, a soccer pal I met when I first came to this island.

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:39.730
Nice to meet you.

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.970
I'm Fei Rune.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:42.390
Nice to meet you too.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:45.290
That Avatar who rescued us is Shuu's!

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.570
God of Darkness, Dark Exodus!

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:48.880
Oh, really?

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.380
It felt incredibly powerful.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:54.950
Fei is a friend who is fighting with us right now.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:55.820
There's also Wondeba.

00:07:57.140 --> 00:08:00.820
I am the great coach of this team, Clark Wonderbat!

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:02.280
Call me Wondeba-sama!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.110
It's... a bear?

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.560
Who are you calling a bear?!

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:07.810
Now, now...

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:12.010
Shuu, do you live on this island?

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.840
Yes, I guess you could say that.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:24.350
Fifth Sector coerced us into coming to this island, saying that it was a training camp.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.540
We had a match with Shuu and we even trained with him.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:34.960
Fighting with Shuu at God Eden Stadium was one of the fiercest I'd ever played.

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:39.530
That match made me feel as if I'd gotten stronger.

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:43.210
A lot happened to us on this island.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.380
Yeah.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.460
How have you been doing since then, Shuu?

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.100
Never mind that, Tenma.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:56.130
I came because I wanted to tell you something.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.410
Tell us something?

00:08:58.090 --> 00:08:59.820
About Avatar Armed.

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:02.250
You know about it?!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.160
Yeah.

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:07.360
You'll definitely need Avatar Armed to fight these guys.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:10.110
Fortunately, all of you are Avatar users.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:13.390
I want you to get an understanding of Avatar Armed on this island.

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:16.610
The soccer god here will definitely help you.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:20.160
Wow, Shuu! You know everything!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.840
Maybe it's you who's actually the soccer god!

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:24.270
No way.

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:26.670
Okay then, everyone! Let's do it!

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:27.920
Avatar Armed!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:28.820
Yeah!

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:30.230
I'm all fired up!

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:32.750
So we're holding training camp here again, huh?

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:34.920
Then let's get started!

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:35.690
Wait!

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:37.590
W-What?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.100
You've gotten too much damage from that previous battle.

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:42.160
You should take it easy today and rest.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.280
Yep.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:46.830
Avatar Armed uses up a lot of energy, doesn't it?

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:47.380
Yes...

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:51.300
Then listen to your managers.

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:54.790
Keeping you in top physical form is a part of our jobs.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:57.350
Look who's talking all mature and responsible!

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:59.420
O-Of course I am!

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:00.820
Now she's mad!

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:02.790
Nishiki! Hold it right there!

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.010
Hey, Tsurugi.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:18.240
Yes?

00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:21.490
About what those guys said this afternoon...

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.750
They mentioned anger.

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:25.720
Yes.

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:29.070
I was a bit surprised when I heard that.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:34.420
They attacked us because they were angry for their captain.

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:40.350
Until now, I thought that maybe people from the future didn't have emotions like that...

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:44.450
But they care about the people they're close to, too.

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:48.130
They're human, just like us.

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:53.470
Fei is from the future too... isn't he...

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.190
Wow!

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:56.480
Hurry up!

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:57.880
Don't rush me!

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:00.320
It's so pretty.

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:06.600
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:11.430
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:17.850
Now, let's begin training for Avatar Armed.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.930
So... here?

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:24.530
It's easier to concentrate in this area.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:32.790
What is he doing?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.300
Um, Shuu...

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.300
Copy what I'm doing.

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:40.670
You want to use Avatar Armed, don't you?

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.000
Yeah, but...

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:44.870
Is this all it takes?

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:46.730
You're just standing there.

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.220
It won't hurt to try it out.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:50.680
Yeah.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.740
It must have some kind of benefit.

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:54.150
Let's do it.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:59.020
Why are you joining them?

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:00.700
I thought I could do it, too.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:09.490
Guys, keep your eyes closed and listen to me.

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:12.240
Quiet down your heart.

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:15.950
Think about what you want to protect and wish to gain even greater strength.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:23.050
The force of those feelings will draw you and your Avatar closer.

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:26.770
Feel that?

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:27.930
The wind is coming.

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:37.300
Imagine your Avatar surrounding your whole body, much like a wind that wraps around you.

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:42.530
The wind on this island wants to be one with you.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.530
One with the wind...

00:12:58.100 --> 00:12:59.830
I feel it...

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:03.530
I feel something getting closer to me.

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:06.840
It's the same feeling I had when I first brought out my Avatar...

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:11.350
That hot feeling like it's about to burst open...

00:13:11.570 --> 00:13:12.380
Yeah...

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.390
Do you feel that, Tsurugi?

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.060
Yes.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:25.880
I'm really close to soccer right now!

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:33.140
Could this feeling be it?

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.860
Yeah, it feels different from anything I've ever experienced.

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:37.510
I feel it too.

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:38.480
Me too!

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:41.570
Let's keep it in mind and go train on the grounds!

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:42.810
Yeah!

00:13:42.810 --> 00:13:43.720
Let's do it!

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.880
You're a mysterious one, Shuu.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:51.570
You're fighting with Tenma and the others because you have something you want to protect too, don't you?

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.350
Yeah.

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:09.640
Found you.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:13.140
We haven't finished our soccer battle yet.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:15.310
Team A5.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:17.360
You're persistent.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.280
That Avatar yesterday belongs to you, does it?

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:22.540
Don't get in our way next time.

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:25.350
You have to fight, Tenma.

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:31.750
A soccer battle.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:35.920
The rule will be whoever scores first, wins.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.380
Okay.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:38.060
Bring it!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:39.450
Then we'll begin.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.120
Wonder Trap!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.540
Tenma, go!

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.950
That's it! Now go Avatar Armed!

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:08.320
I'll do it!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:13.030
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:15.090
Armed!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:23.260
No good!

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.840
Quit trying to scare us!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:27.970
Reiza!

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:32.590
I won't let you!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.350
Olympus Harmony!

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:46.930
Shin-sama is so amazing!

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:50.120
I only hope this wind will lead them to Avatar Armed.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:56.150
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.240
Armed!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:08.540
Guys, don't let Avatar Armed take up all of your attention!

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:13.250
Tsurugi may be right.

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:18.200
Too much focus on Avatar Armed, and it will automatically kill this momentum we've picked up.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.560
Tenma and the gang are doing their best to defend.

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.920
But it's taking everything they've got.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.100
They can't switch over to offense.

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:30.590
If only there was something else that could give them a push.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.760
Wondeba.

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.130
Join me and Tenma together!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.000
What?!

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:39.360
Do you mean Mixi-max?!

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.630
You even know about Mixi-max?

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:46.600
I want to give their heightened feelings a boost.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:49.570
Okay.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:57.260
Tenma, time to Mixi-max!

00:16:58.290 --> 00:16:59.050
Me?!

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:09.170
Now that's uncalled for.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:21.310
Are you okay?

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:23.730
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:25.990
Tenma?

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:28.620
He looks changed!

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:30.880
So this is Mixi-max.

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:31.690
Yes!

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:35.140
I fused Tenma with Shuu's aura.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:39.490
Now Tenma can power up using Shuu's strength!

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:43.010
Wow... I feel power surging through me.

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:44.080
Okay!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.420
It's no use.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:50.540
Yahoo!

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:54.340
My power will pull you up.

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:59.510
Your wish to protect what you love overlaps with my feelings.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:03.010
That will bring out Avatar Armed.

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:04.350
Stop him!

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:07.290
Shuu!

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:09.600
I'll live up to this power you've given me!

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.120
To protect soccer!

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.650
Now, Tenma!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.150
It's time to show your own strength!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.070
Okay!

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:23.350
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.290
Armed!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:44.130
He finally did it!

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:48.960
Come on!

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:58.230
Keeper Command 03!

00:18:58.230 --> 00:18:59.450
<Boom Shout>

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:08.300
Yes!

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:10.670
We got a point!

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:12.610
That means we win!

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:13.880
You did it, Tenma!

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:17.200
I don't believe this.

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:23.120
But rules are rules.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:30.600
Tenma.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:33.000
You were amazing, Tenma!

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.150
I was so impressed!

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:37.710
Thank you, Shuu.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:41.420
All I did was push you from behind.

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:44.640
Now you've gotten even stronger again.

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:47.690
You'll be a big proponent in the fights to come.

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:48.700
Yeah!

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:50.950
It's your turn next, guys.

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:51.830
Yeah.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:53.340
We'll work hard too.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:58.560
It's from Otonashi-sensei.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:19:59.840
Hello.

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:01.830
Yes.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:04.010
Really?

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:06.200
Bad news, everyone!

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:09.230
They're going to demolish Raimon's soccer building!

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.960
You guys should hurry back.

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.200
You have soccer to protect.

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:17.710
Then why don't you come with us, Shuu?

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:18.830
I want you to join the team.

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:21.940
Sorry.

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:27.870
I can't go.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:28.620
Why not?

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:33.440
I have to stay and protect this island.

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:37.050
It's a really important job.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:39.690
I see.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:43.130
Come back whenever you feel like training again.

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:45.480
Okay. Thanks!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:03.520
Tenma.

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:06.200
I'm glad I was able to help you.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.410
Make sure to take back the real timeline.

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:17.920
He's a good friend.

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:22.410
Yeah.

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:56.380
Our next fight takes place in the future!

00:22:56.380 --> 00:22:59.980
We'll find a hint to forming the strongest soccer team!

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:03.200
Next, Get The Holy Book of Champions!

00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:05.110
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:19.010
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:23.190 --> 00:23:25.840
Listen to your managers!

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:26.760
That's all!
